A '''Dragon Egg in a Box''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable. It can be obtained from the [[Raffle of the Century]] during Year 500.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Dragon Egg in a Box''' is a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from the Year 500 [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Dragon Egg in a Box''' plays an animation and rewards the player randomly with one of the following items: 
{{RL|1 Golden Dragon Egg|1 Jade Dragon Egg|1 Rose Dragon Egg}}

